## Security & Git

- Never read `.env`, `.env.*`, secrets, credentials, private keys, or tokens.
- Never push to `main`/`master`. Never force-push. Never auto-merge.
- Create PR branches under `ai/`. Active working branch is `<<dev>>`.
- Require human approval for: <<GATED: auth, migrations, infra, external network calls, and any anti-goal area>>.

## Naming

Use clear verb/noun names (`CreateUser`, `FindByEmail`, `<<DomainNoun>>Detail`).
Avoid `Do`, `Handle`, `Process`, `Manager`, `Component1`.

## Source of Truth

When `docs/**` conflicts with the code, **the code wins** — flag the mismatch instead of
silently following stale docs. Read the relevant `apps/*/CLAUDE.md` before changing that app.

## Before Finishing

- Reuse existing code; search before adding a new helper/service/component.
- No breaking API/contract changes (see `docs/contracts/`); keep the response shape stable.
- Update tests when you change behavior. Run `make verify` before committing.
